{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 3 click and point adventures inspired by Newgrounds\u00a0horror games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED: a strategy point and click adventure game where you need to collect objects and solve puzzles to secure yourself before a mysterious creature can break in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED 2: You wake up in a house in the middle of the woods, and you must collect objects, set traps, and find weapons to secure yourself Before Nightfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED 1.5: explore a mysterious house and collect items to survive the basement!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808040?t=1762540913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808040?t=1762540913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808040/b630cafaa1881f16a75a8e3ddcc4bbb80085f989/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762540913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808040/b630cafaa1881f16a75a8e3ddcc4bbb80085f989/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762540913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In \"Hunted\" there is a dark room with a collectible step stool object and a rope creaking sound effect, but the room is too dark to see anything.\r\n\r\nIn \"Hunted 2\" you have the option to kill a rabid wolf.\r\n\r\nIn \"Hunted 1.5\" there are bloodied zombies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 3 click and point adventures inspired by Newgrounds\u00a0horror games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED: a strategy point and click adventure